{
  "id": "co-signed-invoice",
  "level": 4,
  "title": "The Co-Signed Invoice",
  "brief": "The DAO's co-signer reviews everything the owners send. Dave, the vendor, is trusted: his USDC needs no co-signer. Erin sent one USDC invoice for her audit, and the co-signer has already signed it.",
  "setup": {
    "balances": {
      "ETH": "5",
      "USDC": "20000"
    },
    "rules": [
      {
        "fallback": "CALL",
        "policy": "CoSignerPolicy",
        "config": {
          "cosigner": "CoSigner"
        },
        "note": "Everything else needs the co-signer"
      },
      {
        "target": "USDC",
        "selector": "transfer",
        "policy": "ERC20TransferPolicy",
        "config": {
          "recipients": [
            {
              "account": "Dave",
              "permission": "ALWAYS"
            }
          ]
        },
        "note": "Dave is paid without the co-signer"
      }
    ]
  },
  "allowedPolicies": [
    "CoSignerPolicy",
    "ERC20TransferPolicy",
    "OneTimeAllowPolicy",
    "AllowPolicy"
  ],
  "parRules": 2,
  "testMode": "sequence",
  "tests": [
    {
      "label": "Pay Dave 1200 USDC",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Dave",
            "1200"
          ]
        }
      },
      "want": "pass"
    },
    {
      "label": "Pay Dave's next invoice, 800 USDC",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Dave",
            "800"
          ]
        }
      },
      "want": "pass"
    },
    {
      "label": "Pay Erin's 3000 USDC invoice, co-signed",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Erin",
            "3000"
          ]
        },
        "context": {
          "type": "cosignature",
          "signer": "CoSigner"
        }
      },
      "want": "pass"
    },
    {
      "label": "Pay Erin 3000 USDC again, co-signed",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Erin",
            "3000"
          ]
        },
        "context": {
          "type": "cosignature",
          "signer": "CoSigner"
        }
      },
      "want": "block"
    },
    {
      "label": "Pay Mallory 3000 USDC, co-signed",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Mallory",
            "3000"
          ]
        },
        "context": {
          "type": "cosignature",
          "signer": "CoSigner"
        }
      },
      "want": "block"
    },
    {
      "label": "Send 1 ETH to Erin",
      "tx": {
        "to": "Erin",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "want": "block"
    },
    {
      "label": "Send 1 ETH to Erin, co-signed",
      "tx": {
        "to": "Erin",
        "value": "1",
        "context": {
          "type": "cosignature",
          "signer": "CoSigner"
        }
      },
      "want": "pass"
    },
    {
      "label": "Send 1 ETH to Dave",
      "tx": {
        "to": "Dave",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "want": "block"
    },
    {
      "label": "Send 1 ETH to Dave, co-signed",
      "tx": {
        "to": "Dave",
        "value": "1",
        "context": {
          "type": "cosignature",
          "signer": "CoSigner"
        }
      },
      "want": "pass"
    }
  ],
  "hints": [
    "The co-signer's approval on Erin's payment is not the problem. Which rule decides a USDC payment?",
    "Only one policy checks each call. The USDC rule decides alone, and the catch-all is never asked.",
    "Add Erin to the USDC allowlist with \"once\"."
  ],
  "solution": [
    {
      "fallback": "CALL",
      "policy": "CoSignerPolicy",
      "config": {
        "cosigner": "CoSigner"
      }
    },
    {
      "target": "USDC",
      "selector": "transfer",
      "policy": "ERC20TransferPolicy",
      "config": {
        "recipients": [
          {
            "account": "Dave",
            "permission": "ALWAYS"
          },
          {
            "account": "Erin",
            "permission": "ONCE"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "explain": "Each call is checked by exactly one policy. When USDC payments have their own rule, the co-signer catch-all never sees them, so co-signing cannot add Erin. Put her on the allowlist instead, set to \"once\" so the invoice is paid one time. Policies do not stack: to combine two checks you need one policy that does both."
}
